// A mode is declared as a `## name` subsection of `Modes`, with a `kinds` entry.

# Patterns
a
b

## stray

# Modes
old: a b

## main
kinds: a
kinds: b
patterns: a

## empty

## bad name

##

## inline: x
kinds: a

## other
kinds
  a

### deep

# Transitions
main : a :: old : a
main : a :: empty : a
main : a :: other : a
